  "review_conclusions": [
    "Exact reviewed Node guard and manifest retained; guard checks full hash, stable stat, root ownership, regular executable mode, and ELF64 x86-64 without executing Node.",
    "Absolute helper argv preserves bounded PATH, and Node metadata verification occurs before post-DATA reads in common admission and before helper Popen in worker native I/O.",
    "Pinned E44 private feature bank is deliberately admitted with epoch44 origin; fresh BGE/native containers use epoch45. Vector codec has no epoch expectation and is byte-identical to E44.",
    "All 12 old inputs remain DEV. CORE admission requires zero new choice copies, inherited12 opaque tokens, E44 feature/vault origin, exposed-DEV-forever freshness, and no protected confirmation decoding.",
    "Dispatch/outer/observer retain canonical supervisor startticks identity, separate log directories, no retry, 570-second work fence, supervisor cleanup and 595/600-second outer bounds, strict stable Z0 closure and all12 supervisor invariants.",
    "Reader/probability protocol, packing, counters, source catalog and vector codec remain donor-identical: positive observed F32 N/E/C probabilities, no scoring renormalization/floor, fixed full-vocabulary mask at T1, seed43, two windows, 36 readouts, context1024/prompt767, no warmup, CPU and AF_UNIX guard."
  ],
